---
layout: base.njk
title: Hackathon series
description: Hackathons that run as a series, with every edition on one roll-up page.
---
<h1>Series</h1>
<p class="muted">Events that run as a series. Each series page rolls up every edition we have a page for.</p>
{%- if site.series.length %}
<ul class="index-grid">
{%- for s in site.series %}
  <li><a href="/series/{{ s.slug }}/">{{ s.name }} <span class="n">{{ s.events.length }} edition{{ 's' if s.events.length != 1 }}</span></a></li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
{%- else %}<p class="empty">No series yet.</p>{%- endif %}
